+# Custom VLC Android source changes
+
+This archive keeps the original VLC theme system unchanged and contains only the following custom video-navigation changes:
+
+1. The in-player Previous and Next video buttons are visible even when the service starts with a one-item playlist.
+2. Previous/Next use the active VLC playlist when possible. If VLC was opened with a single local `file://` video, the player builds a naturally sorted queue from indexed videos in the same folder and switches to the adjacent item.
+
+## Navigation limitations
+
+The automatic same-folder fallback uses the VLC media library's indexed video list and currently targets local `file://` media. SAF `content://`, remote/network streams, and files not indexed by the media library continue to rely on the playlist supplied by VLC or the launching app.
+
+## Theme behaviour
+
+The added five-colour theme selector has been removed. Original VLC theme settings, styling, and theme-selection behaviour are restored from the master source archive.
+
+## Build note
+
+This is a source archive, not a compiled APK. The supplied upstream archive does not contain the complete VLC native engine build checkout/artifacts, so the Android build must be configured with VLC's required native LibVLC/medialibrary dependencies before a full APK build can succeed.
